	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Mission",
	"Description": "Missions and objectives of a mode (M12 G4): objectives as data (count events: eliminate, collect, activate; reach a zone; defend for a time), sequential, parallel or prerequisite chains, failure rules and time limits. Progress comes only from the authoritative event stream (counted once, never from a re-simulation) and lives outside the rollback simulation; the server replicates a small state for UI. Missions are chosen by the level's GameRules asset, so they work with a classic GameMode and with Experiences alike. GSTNMissionCore is pure; GSTNMissionRuntime is the server side.",
